## Develop

```bash
uvx --from "pytest>=8,<10" --with pyyaml pytest tests/ -q
uvx --from "ruff>=0.6,<1" ruff check
uvx --from "ruff>=0.6,<1" ruff format --check
uv run scripts/new_skill.py <name>
```

Rules for working here are in `AGENTS.md`.
